WEBVTT

00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:00.976
77,862 becomes cookie fission,

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:04.976
cookie fission is 77,822.

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:07.334
That seems right, I'll go on.
Cookie fission, OK.

00:14:07.358 --> 00:14:11.604
Next, I do 57 squared,
which is 3,249, so I can say,

00:14:11.628 --> 00:14:13.358
three billion.

00:14:13.382 --> 00:14:15.976
Take the 249, add that to cookie, 249,

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:17.976
oops, but I see a carry coming --

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:19.976
249 --

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:21.976
add that to cookie, 250 plus 77,

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:25.976
is 327 million --

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:28.983
fission, fission, OK,
finally, we do 683 squared,

00:14:29.007 --> 00:14:31.342
that's 700 times 666, plus 17 squared